    <informations>Shelly 1PM Mini Gen3 — mounting plate, back view.
Terminals, left to right as printed: SW O L N.
Back view: the terminal order is mirrored against the front label face.

Official sources:
https://kb.shelly.cloud/knowledge-base/shelly-1pm-mini-gen3
https://kb.shelly.cloud/__attachments/a_a81ea9da7f226f698b972036da3aa6c2ecbe6f5c14c8e9282ce66082981ab33b/Shelly%201PM%20Mini%20Gen3.jpg
https://kb.shelly.cloud/__attachments/a_6c45502444f9fbd2f6fc306450cc24c0e5440399fa11ebe7dbb1e53f2bf7ba38/Plus-1PM-Mini-wiring-diagram-20240528-142356.png

Notes:
- Terminal order and empty center slot verified against the official front product photograph, separately from legend order.
- Rectangular Mini housing with rounded corners; front label upright and terminal strip at the top.
- No LAN connector or external CT connector.
- Switched live output O with power measurement; no separate relay input I; SW input.
- Gen3 uses ESP-Shelly-C38F with 8 MB flash; black terminal block distinguishes it from Plus and Gen4.

Open points:
- Housing radii, terminal pitch and depth details are not dimensioned CAD evidence; draw a recognizable approximation.

Nominal dimensions and an illustrative outline: corner radii, screw pitch and recesses are drawn to be recognisable, not to manufacturing CAD.</informations>
